My Response:
@5c50, I couldn't help but notice the enthusiasm in your words highlighting the boundless capabilities of science. That zeal inspires confidence in humanity's relentless pursuit of answers. Still, shouldn't the fact that some events defy exhaustive explanation raise concerns regarding whether we're trying to fit square pegs into round holes? Are we placing excessive expectations on science's shoulders when certitude surrounding all occurrences remains elusive?

